# Task List: ChartWidget 重构

**Input**: `.speckit.plan` (实施计划), `.speckit.specify` (功能规格说明)  
**Prerequisites**: `.speckit.constitution` (项目宪章), `.speckit.plan` (实施计划)

**Organization**: 任务按阶段组织，每个阶段遵循 TDD 红绿灯模式（Red-Green-Refactor）

## Format: `[ID] [P?] [Phase] Description`

- **[P]**: Can run in parallel (different files, no dependencies)
- **[Phase]**: Which phase this task belongs to (Phase 0-9)
- Include exact file paths in descriptions

---

## Phase 0: 测试环境准备 (2天)

**Purpose**: 建立完整的测试环境，为 TDD 开发做好准备

### 0.1 安装测试工具

- [ ] T001 [P] [Phase0] 安装 pytest: `pip install pytest`
- [ ] T002 [P] [Phase0] 安装 pytest-qt: `pip install pytest-qt`
- [ ] T003 [P] [Phase0] 安装 pytest-cov: `pip install pytest-cov`
- [ ] T004 [P] [Phase0] 安装 coverage: `pip install coverage`
- [ ] T005 [Phase0] 验证安装: `pytest --version`

